---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Serafim | Terms and Conditions"
  description="The terms of use for the Serafim social app: accounts, acceptable use, content and liability."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container legal">
      <h1 class="h2">Terms and Conditions</h1>
      <p class="legal-meta">Last updated: October 25, 2026.</p>

      <p class="body-copy">
        These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of Serafim, the social
        app for sharing posts, sparks and real-time chat. They are a binding
        agreement between you and the developer of Serafim. The Privacy Policy
        explains how we handle your data; by creating an account or using the
        Service you accept both.
      </p>

      <h2>Acceptance of these Terms</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">
        These Terms of Service ("Terms") are a legally binding agreement between
        you and the developer of Serafim ("the Developer", "we", "us", "our").
        They apply whenever you create an account for, sign in to, or otherwise
        use the Serafim mobile app and the backend services it relies on.
      </p>
      <p class="body-copy">
        By creating an account, signing in, or otherwise using the Service you
        accept these Terms and the Privacy Policy. If you do not accept them, you
        must not create an account or use the Service.
      </p>
      <p class="body-copy">
        If you use Serafim on behalf of a club, organisation or community, you
        confirm that you have authority to accept these Terms on its behalf.
      </p>

      <h2>Eligibility</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">
        You must be at least 13 years old, or the minimum age of digital consent in
        your country where that is higher, and must have the legal capacity to
        agree to a contract. Where local law requires parental or guardian consent
        for users below the age of digital consent, such users may not use Serafim
        unless a parent or legal guardian has given consent.
      </p>

      <h2>Your account and security</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">
        You create an account with an email address and password, or by signing
        in with a Google account. You agree to provide accurate account
        information and to keep your credentials confidential. You are
        responsible for keeping your account and device secure and for all
        activity that happens through your account.
      </p>
      <p class="body-copy">
        You may not create more than one account for yourself, and you may not
        use another person's account without their permission.
      </p>

      <h2>The service</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">
        Serafim provides social features: posting in feeds and circles, sparking
        posts, and real-time messaging and group chats. The Service is provided
        on a best-effort basis and may be added to, changed, suspended or
        discontinued at any time.
      </p>

      <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">
        You may not use Serafim to break the law or these Terms, or to harm the
        Service or other people.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Harass, threaten, bully or defame others, or post content that
          promotes violence, hatred or discrimination.
        </li>
        <li>
          Share content that is unlawful, harmful, or sexual content involving
          minors.
        </li>
        <li>
          Impersonate another person or misrepresent your identity or
          affiliation.
        </li>
        <li>
          Send spam, malware or unsolicited content, or attempt to gain
          unauthorised access to accounts or systems.
        </li>
        <li>
          Collect or publish another person's personal information without their
          consent.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Your content</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">
        You keep ownership of the posts, comments, messages and media you submit.
        By submitting content you grant the Developer and the people it is shared
        with a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free licence to host, store,
        reproduce, display and distribute that content for the purpose of
        operating and promoting the Service - for example so your posts can appear
        in feeds and chats of your friends and circles.
      </p>
      <p class="body-copy">
        You confirm that you have the rights needed to post content, including
        photo or video content that shows other people, and that your content does
        not violate these Terms or anyone else's rights.
      </p>

      <h2>Serafim intellectual property</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">
        The Serafim name, logo, mark and all related design, branding and software
        are owned by the Developer. You may not use them without permission.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">
        Serafim relies on third-party providers - including Google for sign-in and
        push notifications, and cloud, authentication and storage providers - and
        your use of those services is also subject to their terms and policies.
      </p>

      <h2>Disclaimers</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">
        The Service is provided "as is" and "as available", without warranties of
        any kind. We do not warrant that the Service will be uninterrupted, secure
        or error-free, or that content on it is lawful, accurate or appropriate.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">
        To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, the Developer is not
        liable for indirect, incidental, special or consequential damages, or for
        any loss arising from user content, conduct of other users or third-party
        services. The Developer's total liability for any claim relating to the
        Service is limited to the greater of the fees paid by you for the Service
        in the twelve months before the claim and the minimum amount allowed by
        applicable law.
      </p>

      <h2>Indemnification</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">
        You agree to indemnify and hold the Developer harmless from any claim
        arising out of your content or your breach of these Terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Termination</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">
        You may stop using Serafim and delete your account at any time. We may
        suspend or terminate your access to the Service if you breach these
        Terms, with or without notice. The sections that by their nature should
        survive a termination - including the disclaimer of warranties and the
        limitation of liability - survive.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to these Terms</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">
        We may update these Terms from time to time. The current version is always
        available in the app and is marked with a date. Material changes may
        require you to accept the new Terms. Your continued use of the Service
        after a change takes effect means you accept the updated Terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing law and disputes</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">
        These Terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of Malawi, without
        regard to conflict of law rules. Any dispute arising out of or relating to
        these Terms or the Service will be subject to the jurisdiction of the
        courts of Malawi, or to such other dispute resolution mechanism as
        applicable law requires.
      </p>

      <h2>General</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">
        These Terms are the entire agreement between you and the Developer relating
        to the Service, and supersede any earlier agreements. If any provision is
        found unenforceable, the remaining provisions remain in effect. The
        Developer's failure to enforce a right is not a waiver of it, and the
        Developer may assign these Terms without your consent.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">
        Contact the Developer through the
        <a class="prose-link" href={site.repo}>Serafim GitHub repository</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal {
    display: grid;
    gap: 24px;
    max-width: 70ch;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  /* Quiet section heads: the h1 carries the page scale. */
  .legal h2 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
  }
  .legal-meta {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }
  /* Bullet list for the acceptable-use rules. */
  .legal ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 65ch;
  }
</style>
